BlinkOPD contains modified portions of OPD-Aha, Vision-OPD and verl.

OPD-Aha: https://github.com/Echochef/OPD-Aha
Vision-OPD: https://github.com/VisionOPD/Vision-OPD
verl: https://github.com/volcengine/verl

Upstream copyright and license headers are retained in the corresponding files.
Modifications include eyes-closed teacher inputs, first-glance gain, packed
Qwen3.5 sequence isolation, teacher-input reuse, multimodal transport, arbitrary
GPU-count batch padding, checkpoint resume support and portable release entrypoints.

Benchmark helpers under general_eval/official retain their source attribution.
Their reference implementations include VLMEvalKit
(https://github.com/open-compass/VLMEvalKit), MathVista
(https://github.com/lupantech/MathVista), MathVerse
(https://github.com/ZrrSkywalker/MathVerse), and MATH-Vision
(https://github.com/mathllm/MATH-V).
License texts for these components are included in
general_eval/official/licenses/. MathVista's retained prompt material remains
under its upstream Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 terms; the
MathVerse and MATH-Vision components retain their upstream MIT terms.
External baselines are downloaded from their official fixed revisions and retain
their original licenses. Base models and datasets retain their respective terms.
